									backflagging - 
									8/29/2005 11:36:50 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									oh the joy of it......yeah right ;p<br /> anyways this week we will be finishing up with that, we might do an occassional backflag mob here and there, but it will no longer be a priority, since we will be smacking stuff around in elementals and are gonna start working on GoD flagging and refocus on 1.5 epics, DoN progression etc.<br /> <br /> if you are interested in joining AF send me a game e-mail to Iluana or Lilandra, with your level, current flags and how many nights a week you play, we raid tuesdays, thursdays, saturdays and sunday evenings from 6:30PM to roughly 11:00PM CST, those nights are mandatory, meaning if you are online you are required to attend the raids and help your guild.<br /> <br /> i understand that due to RL many people can't make every raid night, but atleast try to make as many as possible and if you're behind on flags, check in with /backforce to see if you can get what you need.<br /> <br /> we need teamplayers, people with good attitudes, that wanna progress and aren't easily discouraged by a few bumps in the road, sorry but those happen. if you fall into that category things should work out great between you and the guild.<br /> <br /> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; see you all around<br /> <br /> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Iluana<br /> 
								</div>
