									more flagging, more raiding, more fun!! - 
									6/30/2005 3:59:13 PM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									so.....hmm.....well we're still looking for new recruits of any class and since we have our lazy period, we especially want some wizzies ;p<br /> <br /> our Roster reflects Main Characters only, we're not gonna make the guild look bigger by adding everyones alts ;p, so what you see is what you get.<br /> <br /> we have rules some might consider strict, but hey gotta have rules to get ahead right?<br /> we don't ask people for a job application or even a trial period, our requirements also are not over the top, gotta be lvl 60+, willing to level up, have a good attitude,&nbsp; and attend our scheduled raids when online, isn't asking for that much is it?<br /> <br /> our raid days and such have a link so you can check out if that fits your needs.<br /> <br /> if you're interested in joining, please sign up on our boards and send Iluana or Thieonne a Private Message with the Toons name, level, class and PoP flags you have.<br /> <br /> we're looking forward to see you join us :)<br /> 
